<div class="flex_column av-1yvf1ji-814d4583c4121f1e35772c41682997e1 av_one_full avia-builder-el-4 avia-builder-el-no-sibling first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m8svw8ei-128a6a260320f71a2e286f48d069f68c av-special-heading-h1 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-5 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h1 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Luxury Alcohol and Drug Rehabilitation in Miami</h1><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8svwfxy-7b0b836b6dc835ff9a54cb5faaf4cda0" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="/">Casa Privée</a> is not just a destination for rehabilitation for drug addiction. It’s a sanctuary for transformation. Designed for those who seek both recovery and refinement, our luxury drug and alcohol rehabilitation program Miami offers an exclusive space where science, innovation, and holistic care meet opulence and comfort. For individuals battling drug dependence, we provide more than hope—we deliver advanced drug detox treatments (SOYKA et al., 2008) with 24/7 care, combined with world-class <a href="treatment-programs.php">medical concierge services</a> to promote sustained healing and wellness. We also follow treatment progress using biological markers (Wurst et al., 2005). Our center, led by <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bankole_Johnson" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Prof Dr. Bankole Johnson</a>, also has done pioneering research in the development of innovative medications (Johnson et al., 2007, 2005, 2003a, 2000) and methods (Johnson et al., 2006, 2003b) for the treatment of alcohol and drug use disorders. Some of these approaches have included the development of molecular tools that may lead to future methods of diagnosis and treatment (Johnson, 2020).</p>
<p><em>We don’t just support addiction recovery – we transform lives.</em></p>
<p>In our one-of-a-kind <a href="about-us.php">Florida concierge clinic</a>, clients experience compassionate, tailored care designed to inspire real change. Recovery here goes beyond breaking free from addiction – it’s about rediscovering who you are, redefining your purpose, and taking back control of your life.</p>
</div></section></div>
