<div class="flex_column av-10xsz48-3639401dc22a2466686aa06c59481b74 av_one_full avia-builder-el-15 avia-builder-el-no-sibling mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-zle7x4-e8156331e0c901b5bf0e4967548d7b92 av-special-heading-h2 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-16 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Rehab Program Highlights</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-yd8xew-83148c15b558d43028f6d0c322feab98" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p><a href="treatment-programs.php"><strong>Exclusive Treatments:</strong></a> State-of-the-art therapies at the forefront of medical science, all available within our luxurious private facility.</p>
<p><a href="unparalleled-testing.php"><strong>Advanced Genetic Testing:</strong></a> Comprehensive testing to uncover genetic predispositions to substance use and identify the most effective medications and dosages (Johnson, 2025; Seneviratne et al., 2009; Watts, 2013).</p>
<p><strong>Customized Recovery Plans:</strong> Therapies tailored to meet each client’s unique needs, preferences, and challenges (Johnson, 2025; Johnson and Ait-Daoud, 2010, 2000, 1999).</p>
<p><strong>Confidential Setting:</strong> Enjoy exclusivity, security, and discretion, with membership limited to just 500 souls.</p>
<p><strong>A World-Class, Comfort-Focused Experience:</strong> From five-star accommodations to gourmet nutrition and personal concierge services, every detail exceeds expectations.</p>
<h4>Cutting-Edge Miami Addiction Treatments</h4>
<p>Casa Privée integrates the power of science and innovation into its alcohol and drug rehabilitation services in Miami. Our medically advanced therapies are designed to heal not only the body but also the brain and spirit.</p>
<ul>
<li>Extended-hours, highly supervised outpatient care (up to 23 hours/day while on site). No overnight stays. No inpatient admission.</li>
<li>Non-residential intensive program with continuous staff supervision during operating hours; after-hours clinician on-call support available.</li>
<li>High-acuity outpatient monitoring and concierge supervision—patients return home/hotel nightly.</li>
</ul>
</div></section></div></div></div><div class="flex_cell av-36fby0-3a080025c672263de098c688080cc5ed av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin avia-builder-el-18 el_after_av_cell_one_half avia-builder-el-last content-align-top avia-full-stretch"><div class="flex_cell_inner">
