<section class="av_textblock_section av-miepdw0r-d6e29e35e66e8cf5d53f746d76115e13" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Casa Privée is transforming addiction treatment with <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">NeuroStar’s cutting-edge TMS (Transcranial Magnetic Stimulation)</a> technology. Here’s how it works and the benefits:</p>
<p><a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Targeted Brain Stimulation:</strong> TMS</a> delivers magnetic pulses to stimulate regions of the brain associated with dependency (Harel et al., 2022; Zangen et al., 2021). This stimulation may be associated with a reduction in craving for substances including alcohol, nicotine (i.e., smoking), and cocaine (Amerio et al., 2023; Belgers et al., 2022; Bellamoli et al., 2014; Bolloni et al., 2016; Dinur-Klein et al., 2014; Li et al., 2020; Madeo et al., 2020; Martinotti et al., 2022; Mishra et al., 2010).</p>
<p>TMS also delivers magnetic pulses to stimulate regions of the brain associated with complications of alcohol or drug dependency such as depression and anxiety (Croarkin et al., 2021; Croarkin and MacMaster, 2019; Levkovitz et al., 2015; Li et al., 2014).</p>
<p><strong>Noninvasive &amp; Medication-Free:</strong> A safe, pain-free treatment that doesn’t rely on medication.</p>
<p><strong>Improved Brain Function:</strong> Helps regulate mood, reduce anxiety, and minimize cravings.</p>
<p><strong>Proven Results:</strong> Clients report better mental clarity, emotional stability, and increased resilience.</p>
<p><strong>Lasting Recovery:</strong> By addressing the root neurological causes of addiction, TMS supports profound, long-term recovery(Kedzior and Gellersen, 2018).</p>
<p>Discover a revolutionary, science-backed approach to overcoming substance abuse with <a href="neurostar-tms-therapy.php">Miami TMS therapy</a> (Bellamoli et al., 2014).</p>
</div></section></div>
