<section class="av_textblock_section av-m8swaann-be228b094df356a2b1222843069fc08f" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>For those seeking discretion and privacy, our exclusive VIP outpatient recovery program offers an experience tailored to high-profile individuals. With anonymized records, a dedicated sober living companion, and VIP security, we ensure complete confidentiality. Focus on recovery in peace, knowing your privacy is protected.</p>
<p>We provide a full concierge service that can include booking your commercial or private flights to and from Miami, and accommodation and entertainment for other traveling family members. All this is at your fingertips – just one call away.</p>
<p>We provide all levels of security services for your safety and comfort.</p>
</div></section>
