<section class="av_textblock_section av-mieqkw16-bb90fa492a9665be3eee45232c0912de" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>Our team is led by <a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Prof. Dr. Bankole Johnson</a>, an award-winning , visionary leader, and one of the foremost physician scientists globally in addiction medicine and neuroscience, with over 250 scientific publications, senior leadership roles at major teaching universities, and specialist training in psychiatry, medicine, pharmacology, molecular genetics and neuroscience.  For further details, please visit: <a href="https://bankolejohnson.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">www.bankolejohnson.com</a>.  These innovative programs are all personally designed, curated, and optimized by Prof. Dr. Bankole Johnson.</p>
